cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use proc-sim-agent, please cite it as below."
title: "proc-sim-agent: Claude Code plugins for chemical process simulation"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Claude Code plugins that ground answers about process simulation software in the user's own
  locally installed product help, simulation files and literature. The first plugin covers
  Aspen Plus: full-text index of the local help and of the example-model library, run-history,
  report and Control Panel parsers, stream balance and KPI checks, an input-file writer workflow
  with a checker, staged model building, inline-Fortran checks, model review and version
  comparison, and a curated knowledge base of run messages and calculator practice.
authors:
  - family-names: Usosky
    given-names: Denis
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6245-5110"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-04
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/usosky/proc-sim-agent"
keywords:
  - process simulation
  - Aspen Plus
  - chemical engineering
  - Claude Code
  - agent skills
